{"lines": [{"text": "Imagine you wake up one morning, and your body has simply... stopped aging.", "start": 0.8, "end": 5.768, "spec": {"shot": "wake", "era": "wonder", "chip": "DAY 1 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Imagine", 0.108, 0.538], ["you", 0.551, 0.659], ["wake", 0.672, 0.914], ["up", 0.927, 1.129], ["one", 1.142, 1.357], ["morning", 1.371, 1.788], ["and", 2.177, 2.231], ["your", 2.245, 2.379], ["body", 2.392, 2.782], ["has", 2.796, 2.984], ["simply", 2.997, 3.562], ["stopped", 3.777, 4.207], ["aging", 4.22, 4.57]]}, {"text": "No wrinkles. No gray hair. No back pain. Ever.", "start": 6.468, "end": 10.932, "spec": {"shot": "mirror", "era": "wonder", "chip": "DAY 1 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["No", 0.108, 0.282], ["wrinkles", 0.296, 0.86], ["No", 1.304, 1.465], ["gray", 1.478, 1.72], ["hair", 1.734, 2.11], ["No", 2.554, 2.688], ["back", 2.702, 2.957], ["pain", 2.97, 3.306], ["Ever", 3.75, 4.073]]}, {"text": "At first, this is the best thing that has ever happened to you. You're basically a superhero.", "start": 11.632, "end": 17.416, "spec": {"shot": "hype", "era": "wonder", "chip": "DAY 1 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["At", 0.108, 0.215], ["first", 0.229, 0.753], ["this", 0.981, 1.169], ["is", 1.183, 1.304], ["the", 1.317, 1.438], ["best", 1.452, 1.815], ["thing", 1.828, 2.083], ["that", 2.097, 2.204], ["has", 2.218, 2.446], ["ever", 2.608, 2.823], ["happened", 2.836, 3.212], ["to", 3.226, 3.333], ["you", 3.347, 3.548], ["You're", 3.992, 4.113], ["basically", 4.126, 4.624], ["a", 4.637, 4.691], ["superhero", 4.704, 5.376]]}, {"text": "This is your life if you never aged.", "start": 18.116, "end": 20.54, "spec": {"shot": "title", "era": "title", "chip": null}, "afx": null, "words": [["This", 0.108, 0.296], ["is", 0.309, 0.417], ["your", 0.43, 0.565], ["life", 0.578, 0.954], ["if", 1.062, 1.156], ["you", 1.169, 1.25], ["never", 1.263, 1.573], ["aged", 1.586, 2.03]]}, {"text": "The first thing you notice is that the pressure is gone. No more, I'm getting too old for this. No ticking clock. Ever.", "start": 21.24, "end": 29.136, "spec": {"shot": "nopressure", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 1 · AGE 25", "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.134, 0.188], ["first", 0.202, 0.511], ["thing", 0.524, 0.685], ["you", 0.699, 0.793], ["notice", 0.806, 1.317], ["is", 1.452, 1.559], ["that", 1.573, 1.72], ["the", 1.734, 1.815], ["pressure", 1.828, 2.231], ["is", 2.245, 2.366], ["gone", 2.379, 2.742], ["No", 3.186, 3.32], ["more", 3.333, 3.656], ["I'm", 4.099, 4.153], ["getting", 4.167, 4.395], ["too", 4.409, 4.624], ["old", 4.637, 4.798], ["for", 4.812, 4.973], ["this", 4.987, 5.39], ["No", 5.833, 5.968], ["ticking", 5.981, 6.277], ["clock", 6.29, 6.734], ["Ever", 7.177, 7.5]]}, {"text": "You sleep in. You take a year off. Nobody can tell you that you're wasting your life, because you literally can't.", "start": 29.836, "end": 36.7, "spec": {"shot": "sleepin", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 1 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.108, 0.175], ["sleep", 0.188, 0.47], ["in", 0.484, 0.659], ["You", 1.102, 1.169], ["take", 1.183, 1.371], ["a", 1.384, 1.411], ["year", 1.425, 1.694], ["off", 1.707, 2.016], ["Nobody", 2.46, 2.836], ["can", 2.849, 2.997], ["tell", 3.011, 3.266], ["you", 3.28, 3.414], ["that", 3.427, 3.575], ["you're", 3.589, 3.737], ["wasting", 3.75, 4.153], ["your", 4.167, 4.301], ["life", 4.314, 4.758], ["because", 5.04, 5.349], ["you", 5.363, 5.497], ["literally", 5.511, 5.995], ["can't", 6.008, 6.478]]}, {"text": "So you learn everything. French. Then Spanish. Then Japanese.", "start": 37.4, "end": 42.416, "spec": {"shot": "learn", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 2 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.121, 0.228], ["you", 0.242, 0.39], ["learn", 0.403, 0.591], ["everything", 0.605, 1.102], ["French", 1.599, 2.016], ["Then", 2.473, 2.608], ["Spanish", 2.621, 3.253], ["Then", 3.696, 3.858], ["Japanese", 3.871, 4.624]]}, {"text": "You learn the piano, the guitar, and how to cook pretty much anything. You read every book you ever wanted to read.", "start": 43.116, "end": 50.028, "spec": {"shot": "skills", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 4 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.108, 0.202], ["learn", 0.215, 0.403], ["the", 0.417, 0.497], ["piano", 0.511, 1.075], ["the", 1.304, 1.398], ["guitar", 1.411, 1.962], ["and", 2.272, 2.325], ["how", 2.339, 2.473], ["to", 2.487, 2.581], ["cook", 2.594, 2.849], ["pretty", 2.863, 3.118], ["much", 3.132, 3.36], ["anything", 3.374, 3.804], ["You", 4.247, 4.409], ["read", 4.422, 4.718], ["every", 4.892, 5.161], ["book", 5.175, 5.417], ["you", 5.43, 5.578], ["ever", 5.591, 5.833], ["wanted", 5.847, 6.089], ["to", 6.102, 6.156], ["read", 6.169, 6.505]]}, {"text": "You travel to every single country on Earth. Not on some rushed two-week vacation. You live in each one for a while.", "start": 50.728, "end": 58.024, "spec": {"shot": "travel", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 6 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.121, 0.202], ["travel", 0.215, 0.618], ["to", 0.632, 0.806], ["every", 0.941, 1.29], ["single", 1.304, 1.667], ["country", 1.68, 2.03], ["on", 2.043, 2.191], ["Earth", 2.204, 2.554], ["Not", 2.997, 3.172], ["on", 3.186, 3.32], ["some", 3.333, 3.575], ["rushed", 3.589, 3.938], ["two-week", 3.952, 4.422], ["vacation", 4.436, 5.067], ["You", 5.511, 5.618], ["live", 5.632, 5.793], ["in", 5.806, 5.914], ["each", 5.927, 6.089], ["one", 6.102, 6.263], ["for", 6.277, 6.438], ["a", 6.452, 6.505], ["while", 6.519, 6.909]]}, {"text": "You take every risk. Start a business, fail, start another one. Who cares? You can try again a hundred times.", "start": 58.724, "end": 66.86, "spec": {"shot": "risks", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 7 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.121, 0.215], ["take", 0.229, 0.484], ["every", 0.632, 0.874], ["risk", 0.887, 1.357], ["Start", 1.801, 2.07], ["a", 2.083, 2.137], ["business", 2.151, 2.769], ["fail", 3.011, 3.454], ["start", 3.737, 3.978], ["another", 3.992, 4.288], ["one", 4.301, 4.543], ["Who", 5.013, 5.108], ["cares", 5.121, 5.618], ["You", 6.062, 6.142], ["can", 6.156, 6.25], ["try", 6.263, 6.519], ["again", 6.532, 6.761], ["a", 6.774, 6.815], ["hundred", 6.828, 7.164], ["times", 7.177, 7.742]]}, {"text": "Want to be a doctor, a pilot and a chef? Easy. Just become all of them, one after another.", "start": 67.56, "end": 74.304, "spec": {"shot": "careers", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 8 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Want", 0.108, 0.215], ["to", 0.229, 0.269], ["be", 0.282, 0.403], ["a", 0.417, 0.484], ["doctor", 0.497, 1.035], ["a", 1.263, 1.317], ["pilot", 1.331, 1.801], ["and", 1.909, 1.989], ["a", 2.003, 2.03], ["chef", 2.043, 2.54], ["Easy", 2.984, 3.374], ["Just", 3.817, 3.978], ["become", 3.992, 4.328], ["all", 4.476, 4.677], ["of", 4.691, 4.785], ["them", 4.798, 5.0], ["one", 5.403, 5.564], ["after", 5.578, 5.901], ["another", 5.914, 6.344]]}, {"text": "You even put a little money into the stock market and just leave it there. When you have decades to wait, compound interest becomes your best friend.", "start": 75.004, "end": 83.668, "spec": {"shot": "invest", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 8 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.108, 0.202], ["even", 0.215, 0.444], ["put", 0.457, 0.632], ["a", 0.645, 0.699], ["little", 0.712, 0.995], ["money", 1.008, 1.344], ["into", 1.358, 1.519], ["the", 1.532, 1.626], ["stock", 1.64, 1.989], ["market", 2.003, 2.419], ["and", 2.688, 2.769], ["just", 2.782, 2.997], ["leave", 3.011, 3.199], ["it", 3.212, 3.32], ["there", 3.333, 3.642], ["When", 4.086, 4.18], ["you", 4.194, 4.301], ["have", 4.314, 4.556], ["decades", 4.57, 5.067], ["to", 5.081, 5.175], ["wait", 5.188, 5.578], ["compound", 5.968, 6.492], ["interest", 6.505, 6.976], ["becomes", 6.989, 7.379], ["your", 7.392, 7.5], ["best", 7.513, 7.823], ["friend", 7.836, 8.28]]}, {"text": "Your friends are jealous. What's your secret, they ask. And you just smile.", "start": 84.368, "end": 89.312, "spec": {"shot": "envy", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 9 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Your", 0.108, 0.188], ["friends", 0.202, 0.484], ["are", 0.497, 0.578], ["jealous", 0.591, 1.156], ["What's", 1.599, 1.747], ["your", 1.761, 1.868], ["secret", 1.882, 2.339], ["they", 2.594, 2.755], ["ask", 2.769, 3.199], ["And", 3.656, 3.723], ["you", 3.737, 3.831], ["just", 3.844, 4.073], ["smile", 4.086, 4.556]]}, {"text": "Life is perfect. You feel like you've beaten the game.", "start": 90.012, "end": 93.276, "spec": {"shot": "king", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 9 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Life", 0.108, 0.323], ["is", 0.336, 0.43], ["perfect", 0.444, 0.995], ["You", 1.438, 1.546], ["feel", 1.559, 1.734], ["like", 1.747, 1.922], ["you've", 1.935, 2.124], ["beaten", 2.137, 2.406], ["the", 2.419, 2.5], ["game", 2.513, 2.863]]}, {"text": "But then, slowly, the problems start.", "start": 93.976, "end": 97.096, "spec": {"shot": "problems", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 10 · LOOKS 25", "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["But", 0.121, 0.255], ["then", 0.269, 0.578], ["slowly", 0.981, 1.532], ["the", 1.747, 1.841], ["problems", 1.855, 2.285], ["start", 2.298, 2.728]]}, {"text": "Ten years later, your friends start to notice. They have their first wrinkles and their first gray hairs. You look exactly the same.", "start": 97.796, "end": 106.004, "spec": {"shot": "tenyears", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 10 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Ten", 0.121, 0.269], ["years", 0.282, 0.524], ["later", 0.538, 0.887], ["your", 1.277, 1.384], ["friends", 1.398, 1.747], ["start", 1.761, 1.976], ["to", 1.989, 2.043], ["notice", 2.056, 2.621], ["They", 3.078, 3.145], ["have", 3.159, 3.32], ["their", 3.333, 3.468], ["first", 3.481, 3.884], ["wrinkles", 3.898, 4.449], ["and", 4.624, 4.718], ["their", 4.731, 4.879], ["first", 4.892, 5.296], ["gray", 5.309, 5.564], ["hairs", 5.578, 6.116], ["You", 6.559, 6.667], ["look", 6.68, 6.815], ["exactly", 6.828, 7.312], ["the", 7.325, 7.419], ["same", 7.433, 7.809]]}, {"text": "At first they joke about it. Then they stop joking. People start whispering behind your back.", "start": 106.704, "end": 112.344, "spec": {"shot": "whisper", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 12 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["At", 0.108, 0.215], ["first", 0.229, 0.497], ["they", 0.511, 0.618], ["joke", 0.632, 0.901], ["about", 0.914, 1.21], ["it", 1.223, 1.371], ["Then", 1.828, 1.909], ["they", 1.922, 2.016], ["stop", 2.03, 2.339], ["joking", 2.352, 2.782], ["People", 3.239, 3.495], ["start", 3.508, 3.804], ["whispering", 3.817, 4.314], ["behind", 4.328, 4.718], ["your", 4.731, 4.812], ["back", 4.825, 5.255]]}, {"text": "Your best friend turns forty and throws a huge party. And you still get asked for your ID at the door.", "start": 113.044, "end": 119.26, "spec": {"shot": "party40", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 15 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Your", 0.108, 0.228], ["best", 0.242, 0.524], ["friend", 0.538, 0.847], ["turns", 0.86, 1.169], ["forty", 1.183, 1.707], ["and", 1.895, 2.003], ["throws", 2.016, 2.352], ["a", 2.366, 2.406], ["huge", 2.419, 2.809], ["party", 2.823, 3.199], ["And", 3.642, 3.723], ["you", 3.737, 3.804], ["still", 3.817, 4.046], ["get", 4.059, 4.22], ["asked", 4.234, 4.543], ["for", 4.556, 4.677], ["your", 4.691, 4.852], ["ID", 4.866, 5.228], ["at", 5.242, 5.336], ["the", 5.349, 5.43], ["door", 5.444, 5.82]]}, {"text": "So you start lying. Botox. Great genes. A really strict skincare routine. And every lie needs another lie.", "start": 119.96, "end": 128.024, "spec": {"shot": "lies", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 14 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.108, 0.215], ["you", 0.229, 0.323], ["start", 0.336, 0.605], ["lying", 0.618, 1.008], ["Botox", 1.465, 2.083], ["Great", 2.527, 2.742], ["genes", 2.755, 3.293], ["A", 3.737, 3.817], ["really", 3.831, 4.126], ["strict", 4.14, 4.503], ["skincare", 4.516, 5.027], ["routine", 5.04, 5.538], ["And", 5.981, 6.142], ["every", 6.156, 6.398], ["lie", 6.411, 6.68], ["needs", 6.694, 6.976], ["another", 6.989, 7.312], ["lie", 7.325, 7.661]]}, {"text": "Then your parents get old. You sit next to them in the hospital, and the nurse thinks you're their grandson.", "start": 128.724, "end": 134.364, "spec": {"shot": "parents", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 25 · LOOKS 25", "mood": "dark"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Then", 0.108, 0.202], ["your", 0.215, 0.323], ["parents", 0.336, 0.699], ["get", 0.712, 0.86], ["old", 0.874, 1.169], ["You", 1.626, 1.72], ["sit", 1.734, 1.976], ["next", 1.989, 2.298], ["to", 2.312, 2.392], ["them", 2.406, 2.581], ["in", 2.594, 2.661], ["the", 2.675, 2.742], ["hospital", 2.755, 3.347], ["and", 3.669, 3.723], ["the", 3.737, 3.817], ["nurse", 3.831, 4.167], ["thinks", 4.18, 4.449], ["you're", 4.462, 4.543], ["their", 4.556, 4.691], ["grandson", 4.704, 5.255]]}, {"text": "At the funeral, people who have known you your whole life don't recognize you. They think you're some distant relative.", "start": 135.064, "end": 141.904, "spec": {"shot": "funeral", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 27 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["At", 0.108, 0.202], ["the", 0.215, 0.296], ["funeral", 0.309, 0.833], ["people", 1.25, 1.546], ["who", 1.559, 1.68], ["have", 1.694, 1.814], ["known", 1.828, 2.124], ["you", 2.137, 2.258], ["your", 2.272, 2.433], ["whole", 2.446, 2.702], ["life", 2.715, 3.105], ["don't", 3.212, 3.481], ["recognize", 3.495, 4.099], ["you", 4.113, 4.341], ["They", 4.798, 4.906], ["think", 4.919, 5.134], ["you're", 5.148, 5.269], ["some", 5.282, 5.497], ["distant", 5.511, 5.914], ["relative", 5.927, 6.438]]}, {"text": "Love gets complicated too. You fall in love, but every year, your partner gets a little older, and you don't.", "start": 142.604, "end": 149.66, "spec": {"shot": "dating", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 30 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Love", 0.094, 0.269], ["gets", 0.282, 0.457], ["complicated", 0.47, 1.142], ["too", 1.156, 1.478], ["You", 1.935, 2.03], ["fall", 2.043, 2.339], ["in", 2.352, 2.473], ["love", 2.487, 2.863], ["but", 3.145, 3.293], ["every", 3.306, 3.562], ["year", 3.575, 3.925], ["your", 4.355, 4.435], ["partner", 4.449, 4.825], ["gets", 4.839, 5.04], ["a", 5.054, 5.107], ["little", 5.121, 5.417], ["older", 5.43, 5.86], ["and", 6.075, 6.129], ["you", 6.142, 6.25], ["don't", 6.263, 6.653]]}, {"text": "After twenty years, a waiter asks if she's your mom. Every time it happens, it hurts a little more.", "start": 150.36, "end": 156.72, "spec": {"shot": "motherson", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 45 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["After", 0.108, 0.376], ["twenty", 0.39, 0.685], ["years", 0.699, 1.183], ["a", 1.384, 1.465], ["waiter", 1.478, 1.828], ["asks", 1.841, 2.245], ["if", 2.258, 2.352], ["she's", 2.366, 2.634], ["your", 2.648, 2.755], ["mom", 2.769, 3.132], ["Every", 3.575, 3.79], ["time", 3.804, 4.046], ["it", 4.059, 4.126], ["happens", 4.14, 4.731], ["it", 4.946, 5.013], ["hurts", 5.027, 5.269], ["a", 5.282, 5.336], ["little", 5.349, 5.591], ["more", 5.605, 5.968]]}, {"text": "She starts to feel it too. She looks at her wrinkles in the mirror, then she looks at you. And something between you quietly breaks.", "start": 157.42, "end": 165.124, "spec": {"shot": "mirror2", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 46 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["She", 0.121, 0.242], ["starts", 0.255, 0.511], ["to", 0.524, 0.605], ["feel", 0.618, 0.833], ["it", 0.847, 0.941], ["too", 0.954, 1.29], ["She", 1.747, 1.909], ["looks", 1.922, 2.164], ["at", 2.177, 2.245], ["her", 2.258, 2.446], ["wrinkles", 2.46, 2.863], ["in", 2.876, 2.957], ["the", 2.97, 3.038], ["mirror", 3.051, 3.481], ["then", 3.911, 4.019], ["she", 4.032, 4.18], ["looks", 4.194, 4.449], ["at", 4.462, 4.57], ["you", 4.583, 4.785], ["And", 5.229, 5.309], ["something", 5.323, 5.659], ["between", 5.672, 6.102], ["you", 6.116, 6.237], ["quietly", 6.25, 6.734], ["breaks", 6.747, 7.312]]}, {"text": "Even normal life stops working. Your ID says you're fifty, but your face says twenty-five. Banks, doctors, employers. Everyone gets suspicious.", "start": 165.824, "end": 176.384, "spec": {"shot": "paperwork", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 50 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Even", 0.108, 0.336], ["normal", 0.349, 0.726], ["life", 0.739, 1.008], ["stops", 1.022, 1.384], ["working", 1.398, 1.801], ["Your", 2.245, 2.406], ["ID", 2.419, 2.876], ["says", 2.89, 3.145], ["you're", 3.159, 3.293], ["fifty", 3.306, 3.831], ["but", 4.153, 4.301], ["your", 4.314, 4.449], ["face", 4.462, 4.906], ["says", 4.919, 5.175], ["twenty-five", 5.188, 5.954], ["Banks", 6.411, 6.909], ["doctors", 7.097, 7.608], ["employers", 7.634, 8.333], ["Everyone", 8.777, 9.167], ["gets", 9.18, 9.382], ["suspicious", 9.395, 10.161]]}, {"text": "Try explaining to a doctor why your scans look twenty-five, when your file says you should be sixty.", "start": 177.084, "end": 183.132, "spec": {"shot": "doctor", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 60 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Try", 0.108, 0.296], ["explaining", 0.309, 0.82], ["to", 0.833, 0.981], ["a", 0.995, 1.075], ["doctor", 1.089, 1.559], ["why", 1.573, 1.814], ["your", 1.828, 2.003], ["scans", 2.016, 2.46], ["look", 2.473, 2.634], ["twenty-five", 2.648, 3.427], ["when", 3.763, 3.884], ["your", 3.898, 4.032], ["file", 4.046, 4.435], ["says", 4.449, 4.677], ["you", 4.691, 4.758], ["should", 4.771, 4.96], ["be", 4.973, 5.094], ["sixty", 5.108, 5.659]]}, {"text": "You start avoiding cameras. Every old photo of you is evidence. One picture from the past could expose everything.", "start": 183.832, "end": 191.08, "spec": {"shot": "photos", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 50 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.108, 0.175], ["start", 0.188, 0.417], ["avoiding", 0.43, 0.82], ["cameras", 0.833, 1.425], ["Every", 1.868, 2.151], ["old", 2.164, 2.339], ["photo", 2.352, 2.728], ["of", 2.742, 2.809], ["you", 2.823, 3.024], ["is", 3.159, 3.306], ["evidence", 3.32, 3.884], ["One", 4.341, 4.53], ["picture", 4.543, 4.906], ["from", 4.919, 5.067], ["the", 5.081, 5.161], ["past", 5.175, 5.659], ["could", 5.672, 5.806], ["expose", 5.82, 6.331], ["everything", 6.344, 6.841]]}, {"text": "So you do the only thing you can. You pack one suitcase, leave in the middle of the night, and start over in a new city with a new name.", "start": 191.78, "end": 200.372, "spec": {"shot": "move", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 52 · LOOKS 25", "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.108, 0.215], ["you", 0.229, 0.336], ["do", 0.349, 0.497], ["the", 0.511, 0.659], ["only", 0.672, 0.968], ["thing", 0.981, 1.237], ["you", 1.25, 1.358], ["can", 1.371, 1.788], ["You", 2.231, 2.366], ["pack", 2.379, 2.728], ["one", 2.742, 2.944], ["suitcase", 2.957, 3.723], ["leave", 4.113, 4.341], ["in", 4.355, 4.422], ["the", 4.436, 4.503], ["middle", 4.516, 4.771], ["of", 4.785, 4.879], ["the", 4.892, 4.96], ["night", 4.973, 5.336], ["and", 5.659, 5.726], ["start", 5.739, 6.048], ["over", 6.062, 6.371], ["in", 6.384, 6.546], ["a", 6.559, 6.599], ["new", 6.613, 6.909], ["city", 6.922, 7.339], ["with", 7.352, 7.527], ["a", 7.54, 7.567], ["new", 7.581, 7.836], ["name", 7.849, 8.199]]}, {"text": "No goodbyes. No explanations. Your friends just wake up one day, and you're gone.", "start": 201.072, "end": 206.736, "spec": {"shot": "burn", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 52 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["No", 0.108, 0.202], ["goodbyes", 0.215, 0.793], ["No", 1.237, 1.438], ["explanations", 1.452, 2.312], ["Your", 2.755, 2.849], ["friends", 2.863, 3.253], ["just", 3.266, 3.495], ["wake", 3.508, 3.723], ["up", 3.737, 3.898], ["one", 3.911, 4.113], ["day", 4.126, 4.449], ["and", 4.704, 4.812], ["you're", 4.825, 4.946], ["gone", 4.96, 5.269]]}, {"text": "And from far away, you watch the people you left behind get old, get sick, and die. And you're not allowed to be there.", "start": 207.436, "end": 215.092, "spec": {"shot": "faraway", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 70 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.121, 0.188], ["from", 0.202, 0.39], ["far", 0.403, 0.699], ["away", 0.712, 1.102], ["you", 1.492, 1.573], ["watch", 1.586, 1.882], ["the", 1.895, 1.989], ["people", 2.003, 2.325], ["you", 2.339, 2.46], ["left", 2.473, 2.755], ["behind", 2.769, 3.212], ["get", 3.226, 3.401], ["old", 3.414, 3.79], ["get", 4.073, 4.247], ["sick", 4.261, 4.718], ["and", 5.013, 5.094], ["die", 5.108, 5.497], ["And", 5.941, 6.008], ["you're", 6.021, 6.116], ["not", 6.129, 6.317], ["allowed", 6.331, 6.667], ["to", 6.68, 6.761], ["be", 6.774, 6.949], ["there", 6.962, 7.258]]}, {"text": "And you have to do it again every ten or fifteen years. New city. New friends. New life. Again and again.", "start": 215.792, "end": 224.024, "spec": {"shot": "moves", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 100 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.108, 0.188], ["you", 0.202, 0.296], ["have", 0.309, 0.484], ["to", 0.497, 0.578], ["do", 0.591, 0.766], ["it", 0.78, 0.847], ["again", 0.86, 1.237], ["every", 1.425, 1.694], ["ten", 1.707, 2.11], ["or", 2.204, 2.312], ["fifteen", 2.325, 2.755], ["years", 2.769, 3.239], ["New", 3.683, 3.804], ["city", 3.817, 4.194], ["New", 4.637, 4.758], ["friends", 4.771, 5.282], ["New", 5.726, 5.887], ["life", 5.901, 6.344], ["Again", 6.788, 7.191], ["and", 7.325, 7.406], ["again", 7.419, 7.836]]}, {"text": "After a while, you stop letting people in. What's the point of making friends if you'll have to leave them anyway?", "start": 224.724, "end": 230.916, "spec": {"shot": "walls", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 110 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["After", 0.108, 0.39], ["a", 0.403, 0.457], ["while", 0.47, 0.86], ["you", 1.317, 1.371], ["stop", 1.384, 1.694], ["letting", 1.707, 1.909], ["people", 1.922, 2.258], ["in", 2.272, 2.513], ["What's", 2.957, 3.132], ["the", 3.145, 3.253], ["point", 3.266, 3.535], ["of", 3.548, 3.616], ["making", 3.629, 3.952], ["friends", 3.965, 4.368], ["if", 4.382, 4.462], ["you'll", 4.476, 4.597], ["have", 4.61, 4.798], ["to", 4.812, 4.906], ["leave", 4.919, 5.161], ["them", 5.175, 5.309], ["anyway", 5.323, 5.806]]}, {"text": "You learn to fake it. You pretend to be tired. You pretend your back hurts. You even paint on a few wrinkles.", "start": 231.616, "end": 238.384, "spec": {"shot": "fake", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 115 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.108, 0.202], ["learn", 0.215, 0.39], ["to", 0.403, 0.47], ["fake", 0.484, 0.78], ["it", 0.793, 0.954], ["You", 1.398, 1.465], ["pretend", 1.478, 1.815], ["to", 1.828, 1.882], ["be", 1.895, 2.016], ["tired", 2.03, 2.54], ["You", 2.984, 3.051], ["pretend", 3.064, 3.401], ["your", 3.414, 3.508], ["back", 3.522, 3.777], ["hurts", 3.79, 4.247], ["You", 4.691, 4.785], ["even", 4.798, 5.027], ["paint", 5.04, 5.323], ["on", 5.336, 5.43], ["a", 5.444, 5.484], ["few", 5.497, 5.793], ["wrinkles", 5.806, 6.371]]}, {"text": "Every conversation is a test. Where did you grow up? Who are your parents? Why do you remember things nobody your age should know?", "start": 239.084, "end": 246.98, "spec": {"shot": "story", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 120 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Every", 0.108, 0.336], ["conversation", 0.349, 1.129], ["is", 1.223, 1.384], ["a", 1.398, 1.452], ["test", 1.465, 2.016], ["Where", 2.46, 2.54], ["did", 2.554, 2.675], ["you", 2.688, 2.782], ["grow", 2.796, 3.051], ["up", 3.064, 3.266], ["Who", 3.737, 3.804], ["are", 3.817, 3.911], ["your", 3.925, 4.032], ["parents", 4.046, 4.624], ["Why", 5.081, 5.188], ["do", 5.202, 5.282], ["you", 5.296, 5.417], ["remember", 5.43, 5.82], ["things", 5.833, 6.102], ["nobody", 6.116, 6.519], ["your", 6.532, 6.747], ["age", 6.761, 6.949], ["should", 6.962, 7.177], ["know", 7.191, 7.5]]}, {"text": "And then something even worse shows up. Boredom. You've seen every kind of movie, heard every kind of song, had every kind of argument.", "start": 247.68, "end": 256.392, "spec": {"shot": "bored", "era": "space", "chip": "YEAR 150 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.108, 0.175], ["then", 0.188, 0.349], ["something", 0.363, 0.766], ["even", 0.914, 1.183], ["worse", 1.196, 1.425], ["shows", 1.438, 1.774], ["up", 1.788, 2.043], ["Boredom", 2.487, 2.823], ["You've", 3.266, 3.427], ["seen", 3.441, 3.777], ["every", 3.911, 4.167], ["kind", 4.18, 4.422], ["of", 4.436, 4.503], ["movie", 4.516, 4.96], ["heard", 5.255, 5.417], ["every", 5.551, 5.82], ["kind", 5.833, 6.075], ["of", 6.089, 6.156], ["song", 6.169, 6.626], ["had", 7.03, 7.137], ["every", 7.151, 7.406], ["kind", 7.419, 7.661], ["of", 7.675, 7.742], ["argument", 7.755, 8.32]]}, {"text": "Nothing surprises you anymore. And without surprises, even happiness starts to feel flat.", "start": 257.092, "end": 263.356, "spec": {"shot": "flat", "era": "space", "chip": "YEAR 160 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Nothing", 0.108, 0.336], ["surprises", 0.349, 0.941], ["you", 0.954, 1.075], ["anymore", 1.089, 1.532], ["And", 1.976, 2.056], ["without", 2.07, 2.419], ["surprises", 2.433, 3.159], ["even", 3.616, 3.871], ["happiness", 3.884, 4.516], ["starts", 4.624, 4.96], ["to", 4.973, 5.054], ["feel", 5.067, 5.363], ["flat", 5.376, 5.86]]}, {"text": "Your memories start to blur. One day you realize you can't remember the face of your first love anymore. Or your mother's voice.", "start": 264.056, "end": 272.024, "spec": {"shot": "forget", "era": "space", "chip": "YEAR 180 · LOOKS 25", "mood": "dark"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Your", 0.108, 0.215], ["memories", 0.229, 0.726], ["start", 0.847, 1.102], ["to", 1.116, 1.196], ["blur", 1.21, 1.613], ["One", 2.07, 2.231], ["day", 2.245, 2.406], ["you", 2.419, 2.594], ["realize", 2.608, 3.145], ["you", 3.159, 3.28], ["can't", 3.293, 3.669], ["remember", 3.683, 4.086], ["the", 4.099, 4.194], ["face", 4.207, 4.637], ["of", 4.651, 4.718], ["your", 4.731, 4.866], ["first", 4.879, 5.269], ["love", 5.282, 5.511], ["anymore", 5.524, 6.035], ["Or", 6.479, 6.573], ["your", 6.586, 6.694], ["mother's", 6.707, 7.03], ["voice", 7.043, 7.581]]}, {"text": "And hiding gets harder and harder. Cameras everywhere. Face recognition. Digital records of everything.", "start": 272.724, "end": 279.444, "spec": {"shot": "scan", "era": "synth", "chip": "YEAR 200 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.108, 0.202], ["hiding", 0.215, 0.538], ["gets", 0.551, 0.739], ["harder", 0.753, 1.169], ["and", 1.183, 1.263], ["harder", 1.277, 1.761], ["Cameras", 2.204, 2.527], ["everywhere", 2.54, 3.118], ["Face", 3.616, 3.831], ["recognition", 3.844, 4.476], ["Digital", 4.919, 5.309], ["records", 5.323, 5.712], ["of", 5.726, 5.806], ["everything", 5.82, 6.317]]}, {"text": "You know exactly what would happen if anyone found out. You wouldn't be a celebrity. You'd be a science experiment.", "start": 280.144, "end": 287.224, "spec": {"shot": "lab", "era": "synth", "chip": "YEAR 200 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.121, 0.202], ["know", 0.215, 0.376], ["exactly", 0.39, 0.941], ["what", 0.954, 1.116], ["would", 1.129, 1.25], ["happen", 1.263, 1.707], ["if", 1.868, 2.016], ["anyone", 2.177, 2.5], ["found", 2.513, 2.836], ["out", 2.849, 3.105], ["You", 3.548, 3.642], ["wouldn't", 3.656, 3.831], ["be", 3.844, 3.978], ["a", 3.992, 4.046], ["celebrity", 4.059, 4.691], ["You'd", 5.134, 5.282], ["be", 5.296, 5.417], ["a", 5.43, 5.484], ["science", 5.497, 5.954], ["experiment", 5.968, 6.694]]}, {"text": "So you carry the biggest secret in the world, completely alone. There's literally nobody you can tell.", "start": 287.924, "end": 294.404, "spec": {"shot": "secret", "era": "synth", "chip": "YEAR 220 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.121, 0.242], ["you", 0.255, 0.376], ["carry", 0.39, 0.712], ["the", 0.726, 0.887], ["biggest", 0.968, 1.438], ["secret", 1.452, 1.962], ["in", 1.976, 2.07], ["the", 2.083, 2.177], ["world", 2.191, 2.675], ["completely", 2.903, 3.495], ["alone", 3.508, 3.965], ["There's", 4.422, 4.57], ["literally", 4.583, 5.013], ["nobody", 5.027, 5.444], ["you", 5.457, 5.578], ["can", 5.591, 5.712], ["tell", 5.726, 6.075]]}, {"text": "Some nights you lie awake, wishing for one tiny thing. A single gray hair.", "start": 295.104, "end": 300.432, "spec": {"shot": "grayhair", "era": "space", "chip": "YEAR 250 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Some", 0.121, 0.323], ["nights", 0.336, 0.605], ["you", 0.618, 0.726], ["lie", 0.739, 0.954], ["awake", 0.968, 1.425], ["wishing", 1.815, 2.204], ["for", 2.218, 2.406], ["one", 2.419, 2.661], ["tiny", 2.675, 3.038], ["thing", 3.051, 3.441], ["A", 3.884, 3.938], ["single", 3.952, 4.301], ["gray", 4.314, 4.543], ["hair", 4.556, 4.933]]}, {"text": "Decades turn into centuries. Everyone you ever loved is gone. Only you remain.", "start": 301.132, "end": 306.82, "spec": {"shot": "gone", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "YEAR 500 · LOOKS 25", "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["Decades", 0.121, 0.645], ["turn", 0.659, 0.981], ["into", 0.995, 1.156], ["centuries", 1.169, 1.922], ["Everyone", 2.366, 2.769], ["you", 2.782, 2.944], ["ever", 2.957, 3.212], ["loved", 3.226, 3.521], ["is", 3.535, 3.642], ["gone", 3.656, 4.019], ["Only", 4.462, 4.677], ["you", 4.691, 4.825], ["remain", 4.839, 5.282]]}, {"text": "Sure, that little investment has turned into a fortune by now. But there's nobody left to spend it with.", "start": 307.52, "end": 313.88, "spec": {"shot": "fortune", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "YEAR 500 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Sure", 0.108, 0.497], ["that", 0.914, 1.116], ["little", 1.129, 1.384], ["investment", 1.398, 1.949], ["has", 1.962, 2.137], ["turned", 2.151, 2.46], ["into", 2.473, 2.715], ["a", 2.728, 2.796], ["fortune", 2.809, 3.28], ["by", 3.293, 3.427], ["now", 3.441, 3.804], ["But", 4.261, 4.328], ["there's", 4.341, 4.516], ["nobody", 4.53, 4.852], ["left", 4.866, 5.134], ["to", 5.148, 5.202], ["spend", 5.215, 5.538], ["it", 5.551, 5.645], ["with", 5.659, 5.968]]}, {"text": "And you start to envy them. The people who got old. They got a whole story, with a beginning, a middle, and an end.", "start": 314.58, "end": 321.924, "spec": {"shot": "envyold", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "YEAR 500 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.108, 0.188], ["you", 0.202, 0.269], ["start", 0.282, 0.511], ["to", 0.524, 0.605], ["envy", 0.618, 0.914], ["them", 0.927, 1.156], ["The", 1.613, 1.667], ["people", 1.68, 1.976], ["who", 1.989, 2.083], ["got", 2.097, 2.325], ["old", 2.339, 2.621], ["They", 3.078, 3.145], ["got", 3.159, 3.306], ["a", 3.32, 3.36], ["whole", 3.374, 3.683], ["story", 3.696, 4.22], ["with", 4.53, 4.664], ["a", 4.677, 4.731], ["beginning", 4.745, 5.282], ["a", 5.591, 5.618], ["middle", 5.632, 6.062], ["and", 6.371, 6.438], ["an", 6.452, 6.573], ["end", 6.586, 6.949]]}, {"text": "In roughly a billion years, scientists expect the Sun to be so bright that Earth becomes too hot for life.", "start": 322.624, "end": 329.8, "spec": {"shot": "hotearth", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "~1 BILLION YEARS"}, "afx": null, "words": [["In", 0.108, 0.215], ["roughly", 0.229, 0.632], ["a", 0.645, 0.712], ["billion", 0.726, 1.129], ["years", 1.142, 1.613], ["scientists", 1.841, 2.473], ["expect", 2.487, 2.93], ["the", 2.944, 3.024], ["Sun", 3.038, 3.36], ["to", 3.374, 3.468], ["be", 3.481, 3.642], ["so", 3.656, 4.005], ["bright", 4.019, 4.449], ["that", 4.651, 4.825], ["Earth", 4.879, 5.108], ["becomes", 5.121, 5.578], ["too", 5.591, 5.86], ["hot", 5.874, 6.129], ["for", 6.142, 6.304], ["life", 6.317, 6.774]]}, {"text": "And in about five billion years, the Sun swells into a red giant.", "start": 330.5, "end": 335.564, "spec": {"shot": "redgiant", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "~5 BILLION YEARS"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.108, 0.202], ["in", 0.215, 0.309], ["about", 0.323, 0.605], ["five", 0.618, 1.075], ["billion", 1.089, 1.438], ["years", 1.452, 1.962], ["the", 2.177, 2.312], ["Sun", 2.325, 2.675], ["swells", 2.688, 3.32], ["into", 3.414, 3.696], ["a", 3.71, 3.804], ["red", 3.817, 4.153], ["giant", 4.167, 4.677]]}, {"text": "And you? You're still twenty-five.", "start": 336.264, "end": 338.616, "spec": {"shot": "alone", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.108, 0.215], ["you", 0.229, 0.43], ["You're", 0.874, 0.968], ["still", 0.981, 1.21], ["twenty-five", 1.223, 1.949]]}, {"text": "Maybe getting older isn't a bug. Maybe it's exactly what makes our time so valuable. Every birthday, every goodbye, every moment matters, because it doesn't last forever.", "start": 339.316, "end": 350.644, "spec": {"shot": "meaning", "era": "wonder", "chip": null, "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["Maybe", 0.108, 0.349], ["getting", 0.363, 0.672], ["older", 0.685, 1.048], ["isn't", 1.062, 1.317], ["a", 1.331, 1.371], ["bug", 1.384, 1.761], ["Maybe", 2.204, 2.46], ["it's", 2.473, 2.594], ["exactly", 2.608, 3.185], ["what", 3.199, 3.387], ["makes", 3.401, 3.71], ["our", 3.723, 3.817], ["time", 3.831, 4.194], ["so", 4.207, 4.395], ["valuable", 4.409, 5.04], ["Every", 5.484, 5.739], ["birthday", 5.753, 6.358], ["every", 6.613, 6.855], ["goodbye", 6.868, 7.433], ["every", 7.823, 8.118], ["moment", 8.132, 8.495], ["matters", 8.508, 9.059], ["because", 9.288, 9.57], ["it", 9.583, 9.718], ["doesn't", 9.731, 10.054], ["last", 10.067, 10.376], ["forever", 10.39, 10.941]]}, {"text": "So, would you still take the deal? Living forever, but watching everyone you love leave?", "start": 351.344, "end": 356.96, "spec": {"shot": "deal", "era": "wonder", "chip": null}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.108, 0.363], ["would", 0.591, 0.739], ["you", 0.753, 0.82], ["still", 0.833, 1.048], ["take", 1.062, 1.263], ["the", 1.277, 1.344], ["deal", 1.358, 1.667], ["Living", 2.11, 2.366], ["forever", 2.379, 2.917], ["but", 3.226, 3.374], ["watching", 3.387, 3.844], ["everyone", 4.005, 4.382], ["you", 4.395, 4.516], ["love", 4.53, 4.798], ["leave", 4.812, 5.228]]}, {"text": "Tell me in the comments. And if you want more what-if stories like this, subscribe.", "start": 357.66, "end": 362.628, "spec": {"shot": "outro", "era": "wonder", "chip": null}, "afx": null, "words": [["Tell", 0.108, 0.228], ["me", 0.242, 0.349], ["in",